# Work tracking

Maintain `WORKLOG.md` at the repo root as the source of truth for what we do.

## When finishing meaningful work
Append a short dated entry to `WORKLOG.md`:
- What changed (1–3 bullets)
- Where (cms / web / both)
- Commit hash if committed
- Open follow-ups if any

Skip trivial chatter; do log features, fixes, deploys, dependency/security work, and decisions.

## When the user asks for status / what we did / progress
Summarize from `WORKLOG.md` (and this chat if newer than the file). Keep it brief unless they ask for detail.
